  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Regalia — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, the seal is completely removed as you have perfected a domain expansion that you put your soul into. The domain is filled with numerous types of Lesser Regalia in the form of random weapons. At initiative 20, the Lesser Regalia will attack any enemies within the domain, dealing 8d10 necrotic damage. Additionally, you can use <em>Soul Bound Treasure</em> as an action without spending any cursed energy. In your domain it has immunity to all damage and you can use one of its actions once per turn as a free action.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
